    {
      "id": "8701de72-946d-41ef-87ae-9b5f7bf916b7",
      "title": "Escute e leia a primeira fala da aula.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 2,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "d9c8ac43-d6ed-4c30-bda4-43f2ab310482",
          "textContent": "<p>Escute a primeira fala.</p><p><strong>Me gusta mucho escuchar música, pero no me gusta leer.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Gosto muito de ouvir música, mas não gosto de ler.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/af77b6baa680456d985b82555afba360_b02-me-gusta-mucho-escuchar-musica-pero-no-me-gusta-leer.mp3?Expires=1794099437&Signature=t78pJ2wOxPgf6YptztpjfBu-3eMmWX3kgq2CqPLcx4Eoxt9bVFtrZnjbk6zqKPAuqM3xHnegi6L1Kdx0Z3hXIs33VzBTq~yXNpT7D8b58O4GtOznBemGIkC3NEak9L836nJ1hDXlUhvw2SA0nFsJbOY~4njziXiPYxzXMklhfm92J25-TABte9--baA4xbXcxfB1Re9tD8dK2CSm6UIoGNJKkIoY3cR0pwXMlinwRtQuYtVQnJaI69oOflLISFJ8wWJi57ZsUYUERBYI9p9OBIddcTX3ERQNC1uS647g4g0w7k823w6inNGsW0PVHh34XtygZig9FbjVG0EbLQKcSw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "d876f4a9-13be-40a0-94f9-8e6957a394a4",
      "title": "Leia o cartão e observe o papel de cada parte da frase.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 3,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "69c5d364-763c-4f0b-957d-aa565bb7ab2d",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>pero</strong> vira a ponte entre duas ideias.</p><p><strong>Me gusta mucho escuchar música</strong> mostra um gosto.</p><p><strong>no me gusta leer</strong> muda a direção e acrescenta o contraste.</p><p>Assim, a fala fica mais completa sem virar uma frase longa demais.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "147ce436-92b6-4b33-a580-dc1f3806dd9f",
      "title": "Escute e leia a nova frase. Observe o que muda quando o foco não é você.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "4f857010-bd90-403a-abde-1f20d12101e9",
          "textContent": "<p>Agora a mesma ideia aparece com outra pessoa.</p><p><strong>A Bruno le gusta viajar, pero no le gusta leer.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Bruno gosta de viajar, mas não gosta de ler.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/6a6f589340024e92a7d54970dbeabc37_b04-a-bruno-le-gusta-viajar-pero-no-le-gusta-leer.mp3?Expires=1794099437&Signature=ISJTnqnZZ2Rp-xt9VSI5z1oxMxWUZpXRVP5Wuxy4ptdPvgkArWCEvr-7HIa0aeGi9nSTTwBUuR2b45vES2Yg7KndSog6rYWbV-RTolZHojfDhj2FSJarQfLWO9X-ubpw3goYSxr5Fzhr2geMiYi3q7GkSCS~FnpILtZ4H5pL6HFzraNtx6WN4b25N~HwnftXlklAaC1E67tig5WQoYQE7ekul8Zk39JsX9GX8ZlHa94-OD-uFCN294E9tjxb0OyUhz9wmEnxEHzbo6ibYPnXBmDY2M16b3ZCXEMoPxFRkTaTIuV7LGr8nqnNFfmJmpSIjo6A5d4oYu8sDW~CHmcHug__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "f0c4cef5-6f43-4ede-975d-342076d38fb4",
      "title": "Compare as duas frases e observe o que muda na referência.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "c9794d16-dde8-47cc-ab83-95effb8e2b44",
          "textContent": "<p>Quando o foco é você, aparece <strong>me gusta</strong>.</p><p>Quando o foco é outra pessoa, aparece <strong>le gusta</strong>.</p><p>O resto da estrutura continua quase igual, então a fluidez vem de trocar só a referência.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "678ad318-02f3-4583-b00f-0a86840bafde",
      "title": "Passe pelos dois cartões e observe o que muda na forma.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 6,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "55d8dab6-37ca-4add-b655-1a72b1ce4ff9",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Me gusta hacer deporte.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Gosto de praticar esporte.</strong></p><p>Aqui, a atividade aparece como uma ação.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/93eecf8939414a1cb8dcafebd579ace3_b06-01-me-gusta-hacer-deporte.mp3?Expires=1794099437&Signature=xn2D12pDjgMrSdjezhNn40lmIeNqjinki4om1zEOfcefSkHeRPrR1bMUwIXE1Q1ROwAuL2IShP99T0HwoV1P3GziulIj2Zd5x9t56UJNFBXdZQ6pBtFGYeriYJyTY2xfgz8G6texvFkE~Dv5OC~ZCECuj4dRaUjQvtm6Qmwxlkp5M9dt5LuFGJzwZPXDyjTpBfmaxYU3XIZ-sZKtt1aYDQ5wvfR3KlDPhPxGJ-k05Pcz8T8zO0Zp3Eq162TCvhNfviwGI7ObewTVAbuJC8h7SlOsm5Pf2QaT1glSYwS7y4AYKe7EOcI9RgchkwjaA2um4E~OUyU9UI5n7d3XrtMTAw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        },
        {
          "id": "38308823-1c07-48de-a89b-f49e3731731c",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Me gustan mucho los deportes.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Gosto muito de esportes.</strong></p><p>Aqui, o foco vai para <strong>los deportes</strong> no plural.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/9332d23a2c074c82a60cf2a597758fe0_b06-02-me-gustan-mucho-los-deportes.mp3?Expires=1794099437&Signature=UIXiitqmNQuMr9SKAxdJqCgFHnek9tBCV6ymU2mQl3PcsA08iTfxcDxlwzl3f4dJtheW4jpQlOrpW2qQi4DerYxAwenirnSmQrqQkM1~oiIuVYsXu7HjpxTfYntYTdBRgGrGg5ZsRXwXW5~WAfGzwCzaU4LStaE0WisI5wCGWb-49B7jGoDtKmNsE66VL~Lg9PRLVBzLCSOsvjOYrv24CZIX~-Qc8LOb~4cJXbbtCaPngSBIgsmat3ljwQ3~8KcdrnIcmSZzYijh6JLg405rlOa9MseUIr2bYOYKBrstCgKv6R4oDT6XpbE3OnAHvWwBR~tQj1l3qcSYOGRowGS-1Q__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
        }
      ],
