    {
      "id": "be924bf3-aaf2-4e96-8ecf-a6febb310e58",
      "title": "Conversa curta no café",
      "description": "<p>As falas continuam curtas, mas já mostram mais fluidez porque juntam repertório conhecido em uma troca simples.</p>",
      "contentType": 7,
      "sequenceItem": 7,
      "items": [],
      "dialogue_bubbles": [
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">¿Qué te gusta hacer en tu tiempo libre?</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">O que você gosta de fazer no seu tempo livre?</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/672d5314e0434151851b96009dfbeff2_b07-dialogo-01-que-te-gusta-hacer-en-tu-tiempo-libre.mp3?Expires=1794099437&Signature=slJM87lDdFaJcNTFWoxibIcT1sBOHY-l95PjJQ7EpsyyimkUxYRV7F1dT3uxURHTGN0h10ZEz9mtmNHQ0VTQE62ODkCHFxH-YInMZq2mb3wG85I1H1STuCVv911JA-84TqtGrWQWXTl9QzE4WRxsf6VAgB86d0DHsUoOg-pa7wiBGAGigSa4~9F7r84sOPpbHrH34W0l~qk1GDuFeF~s0mVydFouM38MgqjGD8SPrPobC4bzQZrUdoL4WxwuRxk~A-02a0AOjuQmmPia5CMMSTs0fGPPK0xPg0YQrcmW7mMtYXaGUsBXcCg4rY~5VgVsiC~SVShbN2WXh0jwmrLC~w__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Me gusta viajar, pero no me gusta leer.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Gosto de viajar, mas não gosto de ler.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/8184553071bd45bfaadeae582e6a2744_b07-01-me-gusta-viajar-pero-no-me-gusta-leer.mp3?Expires=1794099437&Signature=m5ETg-QzAMkt2kMfEjK9UQ~snZCU9WLLL7r7CMIFpKwxBH~riLUi~InnrIe9tNVLQbdT4B3UWkEo3jog8YDSSYjqq8FyRKUYCwn~WbEm7QX-Yhrz4H18pyknLpn5fgSKtyhijsGu3BkFnoSWunc9fSO6fL-oHwR8oHxbjaTnnYbOw4UlFQajNflUcBKn1mmyzL4buGVBbBDGF76POHC8JBwnxe4EyS12RLFfuQNwCxsoriE56jJuyUu5J4TNT4SCVIlGaKXDQzkIL96rC7TDoJzNvXf6zvruAC3i45JVytcTucimjLwmN12lKf3pS7gJVT8SpU1yHuI5brRa4Ft7YA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">¿Y a Nora?</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">E a Nora?</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/d50fc94a607d4dbd8f863c55c4b08d44_b07-dialogo-03-y-a-nora.mp3?Expires=1794099437&Signature=yrP~t32bV714kvCXDAFdIdh9rRw9LDIpqWECOf3Lz7xKt7dhXYiSf3PMlskX-HVNhOpAMJB~MkHRPT6MiFSrSJ3CLoxXEiloGwezZqWkkm~WszmrwbuQNLvDowLwVOMYjpIrn9MZGnrVPPQZBiNwRXA82-via7074s-np3dL-Az~3QVqmiR8rPL9md9HRwhqmzHkWWUFZOhrJkDhdQwZqaDI~GWpdkIK62xrbMs0ds0mfEHArkM2YLm9qfrZs-~BZDqkOpDVyWFQi-Jcnr58U5FhIOebZ20tb3mi~NzFhRRgTcujYVh2897MweWMADhTJWWzuWXGvYMKEzV6ttFvWw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">A Nora le gusta escuchar música, pero no le gusta hacer deporte.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">A Nora gosta de ouvir música, mas não gosta de praticar esporte.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/dadfd826d7f8435f8d5becdbbac12984_b07-02-a-nora-le-gusta-escuchar-musica-pero-no-le-gusta-hacer-deporte.mp3?Expires=1794099437&Signature=ayJxbeBB83sk3KdoaXJTRj9lAaa0dF2hrVK8oTZBADoskdjW7MUsgUGqLFt1jufxMjn56NVI6mMrOv862LBe-8Q6jOpnUFm5P0pDxwu84exitBW9f7k8dZI1TzxcNLK~g384FhreT6oYKbDc3vDRlZwvHmdEd-x3p7ptnz0J5lF6LJCEQBVrSsgBd7uAxVei9x7RUzXUR8N9n4pinHYKwSMisA6LhAS~6QH1vFG1cKfDZtRbBrwdEROTOawvKBAys2J0TFJBBU0Qi9kWUs6TcEZhpF8DPLor-LjKuoloC5cDbHbMOzgRmSNzsOD29PUEc8di4rvMe7p9s1g1e3Zrdg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
